hadiths[111]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2304","Ibn 'Abbas (razi Allahu 'anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sall Allahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Do ne'amaton mein se aksar log sehat aur farigh waqt ko barbaad karte hain.\"""""""
"2305","Al-Hasan ne Abu Hurairah (razi Allahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Mere yeh alfaaz kaun apne zimme lega"""""
"2306","Muʿādh ibn Jabal (Allah us se raazi ho) ne riwaayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (sallallāhu alaihi wasallam) ne farmāyā:\n\n\Al-Malḥamah al-ʿUẓmā (buzurg jang)"
"2307","Abu Hurairah (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Maut ka zikr ko zyada karo.\"" Yani maut"
"2308","Hani', Uthman (رضي الله عنhee) ke azaad karda ghulaam ne kaha ke jab Uthman (رضي الله عنhee) kisi qabar par jaate to itna rote ke unki daadhi bhee geelay ho jaate. Un se kaha gaya ke jannat aur jahannam ka zikr kiya gaya aur tum ne roya nahi."
"2309","Ubadah bin As-Samit (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \n\Jis shakhs ko Allah se milna pasand ho...\"""""""
"2310","Aishah (Razi Allah Anha) ne riwayat kiya ke: \Jab yeh aayat nazil hui: 'Aur apne qareebi rishtedaron ko khabar de do...' (26:214)\"""""""
"2311","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Jo mard Allah ki darr karke rotā hai...\"""""""
"2312","Abu Dharr (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Beshak main woh dekhta hoon jo tum nahi dekhte.\"""""""
"2313","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Agar tumhein woh ilm hota jo mujhe hai...\"""""""
"2314","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Beshak aik aadmi aisi baat kare jisme woh koi burai na dekhe"
"2315","Sufyan ibn Waki' ne hum se rivayat kiya, Abdul A'la ne hum se rivayat kiya, al-Jurayri se, Abu Nadrah se, Abu Sa'id ne kaha: Rasoolullah ﷺ Madinah ke ek raaste par Ibn Sayyad se mile, woh ek Yahudi ladka tha jiske baal the (zu'aba), aur unke saath Abu Bakr aur Umar the. Rasoolullah ﷺ ne usse kaha: ""Kya tu gawahi deta hai ke main Allah ka Rasool hoon?"" Usne kaha: ""Kya tu gawahi deta hai ke main Allah ka rasool hoon?"" Nabi ﷺ ne farmaya: ""Main Allah, uske farishte, uski kutub, uske rusul, aur akhiraat ke din par iman laaya."" Phir usse poocha: ""Tujhe kya nazar aata hai?"" Usne kaha: ""Mujhe pani ke upar ek arsh nazar aata hai."" Nabi ﷺ ne farmaya: ""Tu Iblis ka arsh samandar ke upar dekhta hai."" Phir poocha: ""Aur kya nazar aata hai?"" Usne kaha: ""Mujhe ek sadiq aur do kazib, ya do sadiq aur ek kazib nazar aata hai."" Nabi ﷺ ne farmaya: ""Us par haalat garbar hai (lubbisa alayhi)."" Phir usse bulaaya. Is baab mein Umar, Husayn ibn Ali, Ibn Umar, Abu Dharr, Ibn Mas'ud, Jabir, Hafsah se bhi riwayat hain. Abu Isa ne farmaya: Ye hadith hasan hai."
"2316","Anas bin Malik (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke ek aadmi jo unke sahaba mein se tha, marne laga. Toh ek aadmi ne usse kaha — yani us aadmi ne usse kaha: \Jannat ki khushkhabari.\"" Lekin Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \""Tum nahi jaante. Shayad usne aisi baat kar li jo uska kaam na tha"
"2317","Abu Hurairah (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Beshak ek shakhs ki Islam ki fazilat yeh hai ke woh aisi cheezon ko chhod de jo us se mutalliq nahi.\"""""""
"2318","Ali bin Al-Husain (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Yaqeenan...\"""""""
"2319","Abd ibn Humayd ne humein riwayat ki, Abd ar-Razzaq ne khabar di, Ma'mar ne khabar di, az-Zuhri se, Salim ibn Abdullah aur Abu Bakr ibn Sulayman — jo Abu Hathmah ke bete the — se, ke Abdullah ibn Umar (radi Allahu anhuma) ne farmaya:\n\nRasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne humein ek raat mein namaz padhai, Isha ki namaz, apni zindagi ke aakhri daur mein. Jab unhon ne salam pher kar namaz khatam ki, to farmaya: \Kya tumne apni is raat ka gaur kiya? Is raat ke baad sau saal mein"
"2320","Sahl bin Sa'd (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Agar Allah ke nazdeek duniya ki qadr machhar ke par ke barabar bhi hoti...\"""""""
"2321","Al-Mustawrid bin Shaddad (R.A.) ne kaha: \Main un qaafilay ke saath tha jo Rasoolullah (S.A.W.) ke saath ek murda barahmeed (lamb) ke paas the. Rasoolullah (S.A.W.) ne farmaya: 'Kya tum samajhte ho ke is (barahmeed) ne apne maalikon ke liye koi ahamiyat nahi rakhi thi jab unhone ise phenk diya?' Sab ne kaha: 'Ji haan! Isi ki kamazori ki wajah se unhone ise phenk diya"
"2322","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anho) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Suno! Beshak duniya laanat ki hai aur jo kuch us mein hai woh bhi laanat hai.\"""""""
"2323","Muhammad ibn Hatim al-Muktab ne hamain itlaa ki: Muhammad ibn ‘Abdullah al-Ansari ne hamain itlaa ki: Humayd al-Tawil ne Anas (radiyallahu ‘anhu) se riwayat ki, jo Nabi (sallallahu ‘alayhi wa sallam) se naql farmate hain ke unhon ne farmaya: “Apni madad karo apne bhai ki, chahe wo zalim ho ya mazloom.”\n\nHum ne kaha: “Ya Rasoolallah! Hum samajhte hain ke agar wo mazloom ho to uski madad kaise karein, lekin agar wo zalim ho to uski madad kaise karein?”\n\nAap (sallallahu ‘alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: “Tum usay zulm karne se rok do; yahi tumhari madad uski hai.”\n\nAbu ‘Isa ne kaha: Is mazmoon par ‘Aisha (radiyallahu ‘anha) ki bhi riwayat hai. Unhon ne kaha: Ye hadith hasan sahih hai."
"2324","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anho) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Duniya momin ke liye qaidkhana hai aur kafir ke liye jannat.\"""""""
"2325","Abu Kabshah Al-Anmari (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Teen aise hain jin par main qasam khata hoon aur jinke baare mein main tumhe bataata hoon.\"""""""
"2326","Abdullah bin Mas'ud (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \n\Jisey faqeeri ka museebat ho aur woh logon se iski darkaar karey...\"""""""
"2327","Abu Wail ne riwayat ki: \n\Mu'awiyah (r.a.) Abu Hashim bin 'Uthbah (r.a.) ke paas unki bimari (aur maut ke samay) mein ziyarat ke liye aaye. Unhon ne pucha: 'Kya aap roti hain? Kya maut ke dard se ya duniya ki tamanna se?' Unhon ne kaha: 'Na to yeh maut ka daur hai aur na duniya ki tamanna. Balki Rasoolullah (s.a.w) ne mujhe ek zimmedari di thi jise maine ada nahi ki. Unhon ne farmaya tha: 'Tumhare liye kaafi hai ke tum Allah ki raaste mein ek naukar ya ek sawaar ka maal jama karo.' Aaj mujhe pata chala ke maine woh maal jama kar liya hai.'\"""""""
"2328","Abdullah bin Mas'ud (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Tum zameen (estate) par qabza na karo.\"""""""
"2329","Abdullah bin Busr (رضي الله عنهما) se marwi hai ke ek aarbi ne kaha: \Ya Rasool Allah! Logon mein sab se behtar kaun hai?\"" Aap (صلى الله عليه وسلم) ne farmaya: \""Woh jis ki umar lambi ho aur us ke aamaal nek hon.\""\n\nIs mauzoo par Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنہ) aur Jabir (رضي الله عنہ) se bhi rivaayatain hain."""""
"2330","Abdur-Rahman bin Abi-Bakrah (rz all anh) apnay wald say rwayt krtay hyn kh ayk shkhs nay arz kya: \ya rswl allh! lwgwn myn say sb say bhtr kwn hay؟\"" aap ﷺ nay frmaya: \""wh shkhs js ky amr lmby hw awr as kay aamal nyk hwn۔\"" as nay arz kya: \""phr lwgwn myn say sb say brtr kwn hay؟\"" aap ﷺ nay frmaya: \""wh shkhs js ky amr lmby hw awr as kay aamal bray hwn۔\"""""""
"2331","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Meri Ummat ki umar saath saal se saatth saal tak hai.\"""""""
"2332","Anas bin Malik (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Qayamat qayam nahi hogi jab tak waqt tang na ho jaye.\"""""""
"2333","Mujahid ne riwayat ki ke Ibn Umar (razi Allahu anhu) ne farmaya: \n\Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe apne badan ke aik hisse par pakad liya aur farmaya: \n'Duniya mein aisi tarah raho jaise aik musafir ya raasta guzarne wala ho.'\"""""""
"2334","Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Yeh hai Adam (alaihis salaam) ka beta.\"""""""
"2335","Abu As-Safr ne riwayat ki ke Abdullah bin Amr ne farmaya: \Rasool Allah (s.a.w) humare paas se guzre jab hum apni ek jhonpri ki marammat kar rahe the.\"""""""
"2336","Ka'b bin 'Iyad (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Yaqeenan har Ummat ke liye ek fitnah hai.\"""""""
"2337","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Razi Allah unho) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \n\Agar Ibn-e-Adam ke liye ek waadi soni hoti...\"""""""
"2338","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney hamari taraf apney kamrey sey jhaankaa , us waqt hum qiyamat ka zikr kar rahey they, to aap ney farmaya : ''qiyamat us waqt tak qaaim nahin hogi jab tak tum das nishaniyan na dekh lo ! maghrib (pashchim) sey suraj ka nikalna, Yajuj Majuj ka nikalna, Daabba (janwer) ka nikalna, teen baar zamin ka dhansnaa : eik purab mein , eik pashchim mein aur eik jazeera Arab mein , adn key andar sey aag ka nikalna jo logon ko haankey ya ikhatta kereygi, jahan log raat guzaareingey wahin raat guzaareygi aur jahan log qailula karengey wahin qailula kereygi."
"2339","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''log (Allah key) us ghar par hamla karney sey baaz nahin ayengey, yahan tak ke eik aisa lashkar ladaai karney key liye aayega ke jab us lashkar key log maqame beda mein hongey, to unkey aagey waley aur peechchhey waley dhansa diey jaeyngey aur unkey bech waley bhi najat nahin paeyngey (yani tamam log dhansa diye jaeyngey).'' mainey arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! un mein sey jo napasand kartey rahey hon unkey kaamon ko wo bhi? aap ney farmaya : ''Allah taala un ki niyaton key mutabiq unhen uthaeyga.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2340","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''is ummat key aakhiri ehad mein ye waqiyat zahir hongey zamin ka dhansnaa, surat tabdeel hona aur aasman sey pathar barasnaa.''  Aaisha (Raziallahu Anha) kehti hain ke mainey arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! kya hum halak kar diye jaeyngey halanke hum mein nek log bhi hongey? aap ney farmaya : ''haan , jab fisq (nafarmaani) aur fujoor (buraai) aam ho jaaeygi.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Aaisha ki riwayat sey gharib hai, hum isey sirf isi sanad sey jantey hain. 2- Raavi Abdullah bin umr Umri key hifz key talluq sey Yahya bin Saeed ney kalam kiya hai."
"2341","suraj doobney key baad mein masjid mein dakhil huwa, us waqt Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam tashrif farma they, aap Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney puchha : '' Abu-Zar ! jantey ho suraj kahan jata hai? ''main ney arz kya : Allah aur uskey Rasool ziyada jantey hain, aap ney farmaya : '' wo sajdey ki ijazat leney jata hai, usey ijazat mil jati hai lekin eik waqt us sey kaha jaeyga : usi jagah sey niklo jahan sey aaye ho, lihaza wo pashchim sey niklega'' , phir aap Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney ye aayat padhi : وذلك مستقر لها ''ye uska thikana hai'', Raavi kehtey hain : Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ki qirat yehi hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Safwan bin Assal, Huzefa , Usaid , Anas aur abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"2342","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam so kar uthey to aap ka chehra Mubarak surkh tha aur aap farma rahey they : « la ilaah illallah» '' Allah key siwa koi mabood bar-haq nahin'' aap ney isey teen baar dohraaya, phir farmaya : ''us shar (fitney) sey Arab key liye tabahi hai jo qarib aa gaya hai, aaj Yajuj Majuj ki deewar mein itna surakh ho gaya hai aur aap ney ( haath ki ungliyon sey) das ki gireh lagai '' padhi. , mainey arz kya : Allah key Rasool ! kya hum halak kar diye jaeyngey halanke hum mein nek log bhi hongey ? aap ney farmaya : '' haan , jab burai ziyada ho jaeygi ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, 2- (sanad mein chaar aurton ka tazkira kar key ( Sufiyan bin Uena ney ye hadees achi tarah bayan ki hai, Humedi , Ali bin Madini aur doosrey kaee muhaddeseen ney ye hadees Sufiyan bin Uena sey isi tarah riwayat ki hai, 3- Humedi kehtey hain ke Sufiyan bin Uena ney kaha : mainey is hadees ki sanad mein Zohri sey chaar aurton ka wasta yad kya hai : عن زينب بنت أبي سلمة ، an حبيبة ، an أم حبيبة ، an زينب بنت جحش , padhi. Zenab bint abi Salma aur Habiba Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ki soteli ladkiyan hain aur Umme-Habiba aur Zenab bint Jahash Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ki azwaje-mutahrat hain, 4- Maamar aur kaee logon ney ye hadees Zohri sey isi tarah riwayat ki hai magar is mein '' Habiba '' key wasta ka zikr nahin kya hai, ibn Uena key baaz shagirdon ney ibn Uena sey ye hadees riwayat kartey waqt is mein '' Umme-Habiba '' key wasta ka zikr nahin kya hai."
"2343","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' aakhiri zamana padhi. main eik qom niklegi jis key afrad nau-umr aur satahi aql waley hongey , wo Quran padheingey lekin Quran unkey halaq sey nichey nahin utreyga , Quran ki baat kerengey lekin wo Deen sey isi tarah nikal jaeyngey jaisey shikar sey teer aar paar nikal jata hai ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, 2- dusri hadees mein Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey marvi hai jis mein aap ney unhen logon ki tarah osaaf bayan kya ke wo log Quran padheingey, magar unkey galey key nichey nahin utreyga, wo Deen sey aisey hi nikal jaeyngey jaisey kamaan sey teer nikal jata hai, un sey maqam Harura ki taraf mansub khawaarij aur doosrey khawaarij murad hain, padhi. 3- is bab mein Ali , abu-Saeed aur Abu-Zar (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"2344","eik Ansari ney arz kya : Allah key Rasool ! aap ney falan ko aamil bana diya aur mujhey aamil nahin banaya , Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' tum log merey baad) ghalat ( tarjeeh dekhogey , lihaza tum is par sabr karna yahan tak ke mujh sey hoze- kausar par milo ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2345","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' tum merey baad anqarib ( ghalat ( tarjeeh aur aisey umoor dekhogey jinhen tum bura janogey'', logon ney arz kya : Allah key Rasool! aisey waqt mein aap hamen kya hukm detey hain? aap ney farmaya : ''tum hukkam ka haq ada karna (unki itaat karna) aur Allah sey apna haq maango''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2346","eik din Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney hamen Asr kuch pehley padhaai phir khutba deney khadey huye, aur aap ney qiyamat tak honey wali tamam chizon key barey mein hamen khabar di, yad rakhney walon ney isey yad rakha aur bhoolney waley bhool gaey, aap ney jo baaten bayan farmaain is mein sey eik baat ye bhi thi : ''duniya meethi aur sarsabz hai, Allah Taala tumhen is mein khalifa banaeyga, phir dekhega ke tum kaisa amal kartey ho? khabrdar! duniya sey aur aurton sey bach key raho'', aap ney ye bhi farmaya : '' khabrdar ! haq jaan leney key baad kisi aadmi ko logon ka khof usey bayan karney sey na rok dey '' , abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ney rotey huye kaha : Allah ki qism ! hamney bahut sari cheezen dekhi hain aur) bayan karney sey) dar gaey aap ney ye bhi bayan farmaya : '' khabrdar ! qiyamat key din har ehad todney waley key liye uskey ehad todney key mutabiq eik jhanda hoga aur Imam aam key ehad todney sey badh kar koi ehad todna nahin, us ehad key todney waley ka jhanda uskey peeth key paas nasab kya jaeyga'', us din ki jo baaten hamen yad rahin un mein sey eik ye bhi thi : '' jaan lo ! insan mukhtalif darjey key paida kiye gaey hain kuch log paidaishi momin hotey hain, momin bin kar zindagi guzaartey hain aur eman ki haalat mein duniya sey rukhsat hotey hain, kuch log kafir paida hotey hain, kafir bin kar zindagi guzaartey hain aur kufr ki haalat mein martey hain, kuch log momin paida hotey hain, momin bin kar zindagi guzaartey hain aur kufr ki haalat mein unki maut aati hai, kuch log kafir paida hotey hain, kafir bin kar zinda rehtey hain, aur eman ki haalat mein unki maut aati hai, kuch logon ko ghussa der sey aata hai aur jald thanda ho jata hai, kuch logon ko ghussa jald aata hai aur der sey thanda hota hai, ye dono barabar hain, jaan lo ! kuch log aisey hain jinhen jald ghussa aata hai aur der sey thanda hota hai, jaan lo ! un mein sab sey behtar wo hain jo der sey ghussa hotey hain aur jald thandey ho jatey hain, aur sab sey burey wo hain jo jald ghussa hotey hain aur der sey thandey hotey hain, jaan lo ! kuch log achey dhang sey qarz ada kartey hain aur achey dhang sey qarz wasul kartey hain, kuch log bad-suluki sey qarz ada kartey hain, aur bad-suluki sey wasul kartey hain, jaan lo ! un mein sab sey achcha wo hai jo achey dhang sey qarz ada karta hai aur achey dhang sey wasul karta hai, aur sab sey bura wo hai jo burey dhang sey ada karta hai, aur bad-suluki sey wasul karta hai, jaan lo ! ghussa insan key dil main eik chingari hai kya tum ghussa honey waley ki aakhon ki surkhi aur uski gardan ki ragon ko phooltey huye nahin dekhtey ho? lihaza jis shakhs ko ghussey ka ehsas ho wo zamin sey chipak jaey '' , abu Saeed Khudri kehtey hain : hum log suraj ki taraf mud kar dekhney lagey ke kya abhi doobney mein kuch baqi hai? Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' jaan lo ! duniya key guzrey huye hissey ki bih nisbat ab jo hissa baqi hai wo itna hi hai jitna hissa aaj ka tumharey guzrey huye din ki b-nisbat baqi hai''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Huzaifa, abu-Maryam, abu-Zaid bin Akhtab aur Mughira bin Shoba (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain, un logon ney bayan kya ke Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney un sey qiyamat tak honey wali chizon ko bayan farmaya."
"2347","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' jab mulk Sham walon mein kharabi paida ho jaeygi to tum mein koi achai baqi nahin rahegi, meri ummat key eik giroh ko hamesha Allah ki madad sey hasil rahegi, uski madad na karney waley qiyamat tak usey koi nuqsan nahin pahuncha sakengey'' padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Abdullah bin hawala, ibne-Umar , Zaid bin Sabit aur Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain, 3- Muhammad bin Ismail Bukhari ney kaha ke Ali bin Madini ney kaha : un sey murad ehle-hadees hain."
"2348","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' tum merey baad kafir ho kar eik doosrey ki gardanen mat maarna '' padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Abdullah bin Masood , Jareer , ibne-Umar , Kurz bin Alqama , Waasila aur Sunabihi (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"2349","Saad bin abi Waqas (Raziallahu anhu) ney Usman bin Affaan (Raziallahu anhu) key daure-khilaafat mein honey waley fitna key waqt kaha : main gawahi deta hun ke Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' anqarib eik aisa fitna hoga jis mein bethney wala khada honey waley sey behtar hoga, khada honey wala chalney waley sey behtar hoga aur chalney wala dodney waley sey behtar hoga'', mainey arz kya : aap bataiye agar koi merey ghar mein ghus aaye aur qatl karney key liye meri taraf apna haath badhaey to main kya karun? aap ney farmaya : '' Adam key betey (Haabil) ki tarah ho jana ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan hai, 2- baaz logon ney isey Les bin Saad sey riwayat kartey huye sanad mein « رجلا » (eik aadmi (ka izafa kya hai, 3- Saad bin abi Waqas (Raziallahu anhu) ki riwayat sey Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey ye hadees dusri sanad sey bhi aai hai, 4- is bab mein abu-Huraira, khabbab bin Arat, abu-Bakra , ibne-Masood , abu Waqid , abu-Musa Ash-ari aur khadsha (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"2350","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' tum log nek aamal ki taraf jaldi karo, un fitnon key khof sey jo sakht taareek raat ki tarah hain jis mein aadmi subh key waqt momin aur Sham key waqt kafir hoga, Sham key waqt momin aur subh key waqt kafir hoga, duniyawi saaz o saman key badley aadmi apna Deen bech dega'' padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2351","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam eik raat bedaar huye aur farmaya : ''subhan Allah! aaj ki raat kitney fitney aur kitney khazaney nazil huye ! hujrey waaliyon (ummahaatul-momeneen) ko koi jaganey wala hai? suno! duniya mein kapda pehanney wali bahut si aurten aakhirat mein nangi hongi''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2352","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''qiyamat sey pehley sakht taareek raat ki tarah fitney ( zahir ( hongey, jin mein aadmi subh ko momin hoga aur Sham mein kafir ho jaeyga, Sham mein momin hoga aur subh ko kafir ho jaeyga, duniyaawi saaz o saman key badley kuch log apna Deen bech dengey''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees is sanad sey gharib hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein abu-Huraira, Jundub, Noman bin Bashir aur abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"2353","is hadees subh ko aadmi momin hoga aur Sham ko kafir ho jaeyga aur Sham ko momin hoga aur subh ko kafir ho jaeyga, ka matlab ye hai ke aadmi subh ko apney bhai ki jaan, izzat aur maal ko haram samjheyga aur Sham ko halal samjheyga."
"2354","mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey suna, us waqt aap sey eik aadmi sawal kartey huye keh raha tha : aap bataiye agar hamarey ooper aisey hukkaam hukmarani karen jo hamara haq na den aur apney haq ka mutalba keren? Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' unka hukm suno aur un ki itaat karo, isliye ke wo apni zimmedariyon key jawab deh hain aur tum apni zimmedariyon key jawab deh ho '' padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2355","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' tumharey baad aisey din aaney waley hain jis mein ilm utha liya jaeyga, aur haraj ziyada ho jaeyga '' , Sahaba ney arz kya : Allah key Rasool ! haraj kya chiz hai? aap ney farmaya : '' qatl o khoonrezi''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees sahih hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Abu-Hurera , Khalid bin Waleed aur Maaqil bin Yasar (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"2356","Nabi karim Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' qatl o khoonrezi key zamaney mein ibadat karna meri taraf hijrat karney key maanind hai'' padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees sahih gharib hai, 2- hum isey sirf Hammad bin Zaid ki riwayat sey jantey hain, jisey wo mualla sey riwayat kartey hain."
"2357","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' jab meri ummat mein talwaar chal padeygi to wo qiyamat tak na rukegi'' padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2358","merey walid key paas Ali (Raziallahu anhu) aaye aur in ko apney sath ladaai key liye nikalney ko kaha , un sey merey walid ney kaha : merey dost aur aap key chacha zaad bhai ( Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ( ney mujhey wasiyat ki ke '' jab logon mein ikhtilaf ho jaey to main lakdi ki talwaar bana lun '' , lihaza mainey bana li hai, agar aap chahen to usey ley kar aap key sath niklun , Udesa kehti hain : chunanche Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ney merey walid ko chhod diya padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai, hum isey sirf Abdullah bin Ubedullah ki riwayat sey jantey hain, padhi. 2- is bab mein Muhammad bin Muslima (Raziallahu anhu) sey bhi riwayat hai,"
"2359","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney fitney key barey mein farmaya : ''us waqt tum apni kamaanein tod dalo , kamanon ki taant kaat dalo , apney gharon key andar chupkey bethey raho aur Adam key betey (Habil) key maanind ho jao '' padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan gharib sahih hai."
"2360","main tum logon sey eik aisi hadees bayan kar raha hun jisey mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey suni hai aur merey baad tum sey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey suni hui hadees koi nahin bayan kerega padhi. , unhoney Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey suna , aap Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' qiyamat ki nishaniyon mein sey ye hai : ilm ka uthaya jana , jihalat ka phel jana , zina ka aam ho jana , sharab noshi, aurton ki kasrat aur mardon ki qillat yahan tak ke pachas aurton par eik nigran hoga. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein abu-Musa Ash-ari aur Abu-Hurera Raziallahu anhuma sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"2361","hum log Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) key ghar gaey aur un sey hujjaaj key mazaalim ki shikayat ki, to unhoney kaha : ''aaney wala har saal (guzrey huye saal sey) bura hoga, yahan tak ke tum apney rab sey ja milo'', usey mainey tumharey Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey suna hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2362","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''qiyamat us waqt tak qaaim nahin hogi jab tak roey zamin par Allah Allah kaha jaeyga'' padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan hai."
"2363","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' musalman ka khuwab nabuwat ka chhiyaaliswan hissa hota hai aur khuwab ki jab tak tabeer na bayan ki jaey wo eik perindey key panjey mein hota hai phir jab tabeer bayan kar di jati hai to wo waqey ho jata hai ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, 2- abu-Rizeen Uqeli ka naam laqeet bin Aamir hai, 3- Hammad bin Salma ney isey Yala bin Ata sey riwayat kartey huye '' Wakee bin Hadas'' kaha hai jabke Shoba, abu Awana aur Hushem ney isey Yala bin Ata sey riwayat kartey huye '' Wakee bin Adas'' kaha hai aur ye ziyada sahih hai."
"2364","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' khuwab teen qism key hotey hain, eik khuwab wo hai jo sacha hota hai, eik khuwab wo hai ke aadmi jo kuch sochta rehta hai, usi ko khuwab mein dekhta hai, aur eik khuwab aisa hai jo shetan ki taraf sey hota hai aur gham o sadmey ka sabab hota hai, lihaza jo shakhs khuwab mein koi naa-pasandida chiz dekhey to usey chahiye ke wo uth kar namaz padhey , aap Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam kaha kartey they : '' mujhey khuwab mein bedi ka dekhna achcha lagta hai aur toq dekhney ko mein napasand karta hun, bedi ki tabeer Deen par Sabit qadmi ( jamey rehna ( hai'' , aap Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam kaha kartey they : '' jisney khuwab mein mujhey dekha to wo main hi hun, isliye ke shetan meri shakal nahin apna sakta hai'' , aap Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam farmaya kartey they : '' khuwab kisi aalim ya khairkhaah sey hi bayan kya jaey''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Anas, abu-Bakra, Umme Ulaa, ibne-Umar , Aaisha , abu-Musa , Jabir , abu Saeed Khudri , ibne-Abbas aur Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"2365","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' jo shakhs jhoota khuwab bayan kerey. qiyamat key din usey jo key darmiyan gireh laganey par mukallaf kya jaeyga ''."
"2366","Ali (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key wastey sey usi jaisi hadees riwayat kartey hain. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan hai, 2- ye hadees pehli hadees sey ziyada sahih hai, padhi. 3- is bab mein ibne-Abbas , Abu-Hurera , abu-Shuraih aur Waasila (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"2367","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' jo shakhs jhoota khuwab bayan karey to qiyamat key din do jo key darmiyan gireh laganey par mukallaf kya jaeyga aur wo un dono key darmiyan gireh hergiz nahin laga sakega''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2368","mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko farmatey suna : ''main soyaa huwa tha ke us doran merey paas doodh ka eik piyala laya gaya, mainey us sey piya phir apna jutha umr bin Khattab ko dey diya, Sahaba ney arz kya : Allah key Rasool ! aap ney uski kya tabeer ki ? '' farmaya : '' ilm sey '' padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ibne-Umar ki hadees sahih hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Abu-Hurera , abu-Bakra , ibne-Abbas , Abdullah bin Salam , Khuzaima , Tufail bin Sakhbara, abu-Umama aur Jabir (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"2369","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''main soyaa huwa tha dekha : log merey samney pesh kiye ja rahey hain aur wo qamis pehney huye hain, baaz ki qamis chhaati tak pahunch rahi thi aur baaz ki ussey nichey tak pahunch rahi thi, phir merey samney umr ko pesh kya gaya unkey jism par jo qamis thi wo usey ghaseet rahey they'', Sahaba ney arz kya : Allah key Rasool! aap ney uski kya tabeer ki ? aap ney farmaya : '' Deen sey '' padhi. ."
"2370","abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey usi jaisi aur usi maana ki hadees riwayat kartey hain. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye ziyada sahih hai."
"2371","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney eik din farmaya : '' tum mein sey kis ney khuwab dekha hai? '' eik aadmi ney kaha : mainey dekha ke aasman sey eik tarazu utra , aap aur abu-Bakar toley gaey to aap abu-Bakar sey bhari nikley, abu-Bakar aur umr toley gaey, to abu-Bakar bhari nikley , umr aur Usman toley gaey to umr bhari nikley phir tarazu utha liya gaya, abu-Bakra (Raziallahu anhu) kehtey hain : hamney Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key chehrey par nagawari key aasaar dekhay. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2372","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey Warqa ( Warqa bin Naufal ( key barey mein puchha gaya to khadeeja ney kaha : unhoney Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ki tasdeeq ki thi magar wo aap ki nabuwat key zuhoor sey pehley wafat paa gaey, ye sun kar Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' mujhey khuwab mein unhen dikhaya gaya hai, us waqt unkey jism par safed kapdey they, agar wo jahannami hotey to unkey jism par koi doosra libas hota '' padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai, 2- muhaddeseen key nazdik Usman bin Abdur-Rehman qawi nahin hain."
"2373","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Asal ghina yeh nahi ke bahut se asbaab-o-amaal hon"
"2374","Abū Hurayrah (RaziAllāhu Ta'ālā Anhu) se marfū' rivāyat hai:\n\nUnhon ne farmāyā: Rasūlullāh (Sallallāhu Alaihi Wasallam) ne irshād farmāyā:\n\n\Merī taraf se ye kalmat lo"
"2375","Abu Hurairah (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Dinar (sone ke sikke) ka ghulam mal'oon ho.\"""""""
"2376","Abu Hurairah (Razi Allah un se razi ho) se riwayat hai ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \Lutaf (mazaat ko todne wali cheez) ko yaad karte raho"
"2377","Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki: \Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ek chatai par so rahe the.\"""""""
"2378","Abu Hurairah (R.A.) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (S.A.W.) ne farmaya: \Har insaan apne dost ke deen par hota hai.\"""""""
"2379","Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Teen cheezain mayyit ke saath jaati hain...\"""""""
"2380","Miqdam bin Ma'dikarib (R.A) ne farmaya: \Maine Rasoolullah (S.A.W) ko farmaate suna: 'Insaan koi aisi jagah nahi jise woh apne pet se bhar sake"
"2381","Abu Sa'eed (Razi Allahu Anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \n\Jis shakhs chahta hai ke usay (logon ke saamne) dikhaya jaye...\"""""""
"2382","Al-Walid bin Abi Al-Wald, Abu 'Utthman Al-Mada'ini ne riwayat ki ke unhein 'Uqbah bin Muslim ne hadith sunayi."
"2383","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Allah se aaooh ke gham ki jhadd mein girne se panah maango.\"" Sahaba ne arz kiya: \""Ya Rasoolallah! Gham ki jhadd kya hai?\"" Aap (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \""Jahannum ki aisi jhadd jis se Jahannum har roz Allah se sau martaba panah maangta hai.\"" Arz kiya gaya: \""Ya Rasoolallah! Is mein kaun jayega?\"" Aap (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \""Woh qurra (tilawat karne wale) jo apne aamaal ka dikhawa karte the.\"""""""
"2384","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke ek shakhs ne kaha: \Ya Rasool Allah! Ek shakhs amal karta hai aur use chhupata hai...\"""""""
"2385","Hazrat Anas (radiyallahu anhu) ne riwayat karte hain ke ek shakhs Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur us ne arz kiya: \Ya Rasoolullah! Qayamat ka qa kab hogi?\"" Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namaz ke khade ho gaye aur jab namaz ada kar li to farmaya: \""Woh shakhs kahan hai jis ne Qayamat ka waqt poochha tha?\"" Us shakhs ne kaha: \""Main hi tha.\"""""""
"2386","Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anho) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \n\Insaan us ke saath hoga jise woh pyar karta hai.\"""""""
"2387","Safwan bin Assal (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke ek bad-zabaan aawaz wala aay aur kaha: \Aey Muhammad! Insaan logon se muhabbat karta hai lekin unke aamal mein unhe pohnch nahi saka.\"" To Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \""Insaan uske saath hoga jis se woh muhabbat karta hai.\"""""""
"2388","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Beshak Allah Ta'ala farmata hai: Main apne bande ke zehn mein wahi hoon"
"2389","An-Nawas bin Sama'an (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke ek shakhs Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas neki aur gunah ke baare mein poochne aaya. To Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Neki nek akhlaq hai.\"""""""
"2390","Mu'adh bin Jabal (radiyAllahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallAllahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Allah Ta'ala ne...\"""""""
"2391","Hafs bin 'Asim ne Abu Hurairah (radi Allahu anhu) ya Abu Sa'eed (radi Allahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Allah Ta'ala us din apni chhaon ke neeche saat afraad ko apni chhaon mein shadeed karega"
"2392","Al-Miqdam bin Ma'dikarib (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya:"
"2393","Phir usey ussey iska itlaa karein.\n\nJam'e Tirmizi, Hadees: 2392 (Arabic Hadees: 2392)"
"2394","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney hamein hukm diya ke hum be-ja tareef karney walon key munh mein mitti dal den. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ki riwayat sey gharib hai."
"2395","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki: \Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein hukum diya ke ham un logon ke munh mein mitti phenken jo doosron ki tareef karte hain.\"""""""
"2396","Abu Sa'eed (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Imaan wale ke siwa kisi ko saath na rakho.\"""""""
"2397","Anas (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jab Allah apni bande ke liye bhalaai chahta hai...\"""""""
"2398","Aishah (radiy Allahu anha) ne farmaya: \Maine kisi par bhi aisi bimari ki taqleef nahi dekhi jaisi Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par hui.\"""""""
"2399","Musʿab bin Saʿd ne apne walid se riwayat ki ke ek shakhs ne kaha: \n“Ya Rasool Allah (sallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam)! Logon mein sab se zyada mushkilat mein kaun hota hā?” \nAap (sallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) ne farmāyā: \n“Ambiyā (ʿalayhimus-salām).”"
"2400","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Imandaar mard aur imandaar aurat par fitna-e-imtehaan kabhi na rahenge"
"2401","Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Beshak Allah Ta'ala ne farmaya: 'Jab main apni qaid ki nazar se apne bande ki duniya mein nazar ko le leta hoon...'\"""""""
"2402","Abu Hurairah (radiyAllahu anhu) ne Rasool (sallAllahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat ki, jinhon ne farmaya: \Allah Ta'ala ne farmaya...\"""""""
"2403","Jabir (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Qayamat ke din...\"""""""
"2404","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anho) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Koi bhi shaks is tarah nahi mara ke woh pachtaye.\"" Unhon ne arz kiya: \""Ya Rasoolallah! Woh kis cheez ki pachtawa karega?\"" Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \""Agar woh ne nekiyan ki thin to woh pachtaye ga ke us ne aur zyada nekiyan nahi kiyan"
"2405","Abu Hurairah (R.A.) ne riwayat ki hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \n\Aakhir-e-zamana mein aise log aayenge jo deen ke zariye duniya ko dhoka denge.\"""""""
"2406","Ibn 'Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wa salaam) ne farmaya: \Yaqeenan Allah ta'ala...\"""""""
"2407","Uqbah bin رضي الله عنه ne bayan farmaya: Maine kaha: \Ya Rasool Allah! Nijat ka kya tareeqa hai?\"" Aap صلی الله علیہ وسلم ne farmaya: \""Yeh ke apni zabaan ko qaboo mein rakho.\"""""""
"2408","Abu Sa'eed Al-Khudri (رَضِيَ اللَّهُ عَنْهُ) ne riwayat ki (کہ پیغمبر ﷺ نے فرمایا): \جب آدم کا بچہ صبح کو بیدار ہوتا ہے\"""""""
"2409","Sahl bin Sa'd (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Jis shakhs ne mujhe is cheez ki zimmedari li jo uske jubbaan (jaw) aur uske ragon (legs) ke darmiyan hai...\"""""""
"2410","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Jis shakhs ke liye Allah ne uske do jubanon (yaani zabaan) ke shar se aur uske do ragon (yaani sharir ke azaa) ke shar se hifazat farmayi...\"""""""
"2411","Sufyan bin 'Abdullah Ath-Thaqafi (رضي الله عنه) ne farmaya:\n\nMaine kaha: \Aey Allah ke Rasool! Mujhe aisi baat bataaiye jis ko main mazbooti se thaam loon.\"" Aap (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \""Keh do: Mera Rubb Allah hai.\"""""""
"2412","Ibn 'Umar (razi Allahu 'anhuma) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Ziyada baat karne se parhez karo magar is mein Allah ki yaad ho. Yaqeenan ziyada baat karna Allah ki yaad ke baghair dil ko sakht kar deta ha. Aur yaqeenan sab se door Allah se woh shakhs hai jis ka dil sakht ho.\"""""""
"2413","Hazrat Umar ibn al-Khattab (Razi Allah unho) ne riwayat farmaya ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \Agar tum Allah par haqiqi tawakkal karte"
"2414","Ubu Juhaifah (raziyallahu anhu) ne apni taraf se riwayat ki ke unhone kaha: \Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Salman (raziyallahu anhu) aur Abu Ad-Darda (raziyallahu anhu) ke darmiyan bhaai chaat ka rishta qaayam farmaya. Salman (raziyallahu anhu) Abu Ad-Darda (raziyallahu anhu) ke paas unhe dekhne gaye."""""
